{"unit_id":"choco9527__dsh-add-to-chat#card-zh","repo":"choco9527/dsh-add-to-chat","commit":"dd6663f89d8abe16942b46ac5a1a5ec16ce72553","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-add-to-chat 是 DSH Web 客户端的对话引用插件。它在助手回复选区旁提供“添加到对话”操作，把所选文字作为独立上下文排入当前会话。用户可连续添加多条引用，在输入框上方查看原文、逐条删除或全部清空。引用随下一条消息提交，成功后清除，失败则恢复；插件也提供选区操作扩展服务。无需 API 密钥或外部服务。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:136-147","client.js:465-494","client.js:570-595"]}
{"unit_id":"choco9527__dsh-add-to-chat#card-en","repo":"choco9527/dsh-add-to-chat","commit":"dd6663f89d8abe16942b46ac5a1a5ec16ce72553","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-add-to-chat lets DSH Web users queue selected assistant text as separate context for the current conversation. Review or remove quotes above the composer; they accompany the next message and return after a failed send. Selection extensions are supported; no key or external service is needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:136-147","client.js:465-494","client.js:570-595"]}
